  "details": "With the latest open beta build(s), the checkmark on the shield on a user's nameplate is almost perfect. It allows someone to see at a glance who is verified... but I'd like to be able to see who is 18+ verified at a glance without having to open someone's profile and look at their badges. I feel like this should be useful for groups not running age-gated instances, as they would only need glance at a nameplate before allowing someone through, instead of having to open everyone's profiles.",
